('javascript','array-methods','javascript-array-methods-007','some()','array.some(callback(item, index, array), thisArg)','Tests whether at least one element in the array passes the provided test function.','callback — function invoked per element until it returns truthy.','true if any element passes the test, otherwise false. Returns false for empty arrays.','[1, 2, 3].some(x => x > 2); // true','javascript','Short-circuits — stops iterating as soon as a truthy result is found.',ARRAY['javascript','array','iteration']::text[],7),
