('javascript','array-methods','javascript-array-methods-012','push()','array.push(item1, item2, ...)','Adds one or more elements to the end of an array and mutates the original array.','item1, item2, ... — elements to append.','The new length of the array.','const a = [1, 2]; a.push(3); // a is [1, 2, 3]','javascript','Mutates the array in place — use the spread operator ([...a, 3]) for an immutable version.',ARRAY['javascript','array','mutation']::text[],12),
