('html','attributes','html-attributes-009','disabled','<button disabled>Submit</button>','Disables a form control or button, greying it out and preventing user interaction and form submission of its value.',null,null,'<input type="text" disabled value="Read only" />','html','A boolean attribute — its mere presence disables the element, regardless of its value.',ARRAY['html','attribute','forms']::text[],9),
