('html','attributes','html-attributes-011','target','<a href="url" target="_blank">','Specifies where to open a linked document or embedded frame — a new tab, the same frame, or a named frame.','_self (default), _blank (new tab), _parent, _top.',null,'<a href="https://example.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in new tab</a>','html','Pair target="_blank" with rel="noopener" to prevent the new page from controlling the opener window.',ARRAY['html','attribute','navigation']::text[],11),
