('html','attributes','html-attributes-013','tabindex','<div tabindex="0">','Controls whether an element is keyboard-focusable and its position in tab order.','0 — focusable in natural DOM order. -1 — focusable only via script. Positive number — explicit (and discouraged) tab order.',null,'<div tabindex="0" role="button">Custom clickable div</div>','html','Avoid positive tabindex values — they create a confusing, hard-to-maintain tab order.',ARRAY['html','attribute','accessibility']::text[],13),
