('html','attributes','html-attributes-020','download','<a href="file.pdf" download>','Tells the browser to download the linked resource as a file instead of navigating to it, optionally with a custom filename.',null,null,'<a href="/report.pdf" download="annual-report.pdf">Download report</a>','html','Only works for same-origin URLs (or ones with appropriate CORS headers).',ARRAY['html','attribute','navigation']::text[],20),
('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-001','<form>','<form action="/submit" method="post">...</form>','Groups related form controls and defines how their data is submitted to a server.','action — URL to submit to. method — GET or POST. enctype — encoding, e.g. multipart/form-data for file uploads.',null,'<form action="/login" method="post">
