('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-002','<input type="text">','<input type="text" name="username" />','A single-line free text input field, the default input type when type is omitted.','name — key used when submitting. value — initial/current text. maxlength — max character count.',null,'<input type="text" name="username" maxlength="20" />','html',null,ARRAY['html','forms','input']::text[],2),
('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-003','<input type="email">','<input type="email" name="email" />','A text input specialized for email addresses, with built-in format validation and an email-optimized mobile keyboard.','multiple — allows a comma-separated list of addresses.',null,'<input type="email" name="email" required />','html','Browser validation only checks for a basic name@domain shape, not that the address actually exists.',ARRAY['html','forms','input']::text[],3),
('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-004','<input type="password">','<input type="password" name="pwd" />','A single-line text input that masks entered characters, used for sensitive values like passwords.',null,null,'<input type="password" name="pwd" minlength="8" required />','html','Masking is visual only — always transmit and store the value securely (HTTPS, hashed on the server).',ARRAY['html','forms','input']::text[],4),
('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-005','<input type="number">','<input type="number" min="0" max="10" />','A numeric input with increment/decrement controls and built-in min/max/step validation.','min, max — allowed range. step — increment size.',null,'<input type="number" min="1" max="5" step="1" value="1" />','html','The value is always returned as a string in JS — convert with Number() before doing math.',ARRAY['html','forms','input']::text[],5),
('html','forms-inputs','html-forms-inputs-006','<input type="checkbox">','<input type="checkbox" name="agree" />','A toggle control representing a boolean on/off choice, or one option among several independent selections.','checked — sets it as pre-selected.',null,'<label>
