('html','tags','html-tags-046','<iframe>','<iframe src="page.html"></iframe>','Embeds another HTML document (a map, video, ad, or entire site) as a nested browsing context within the current page.','src — URL to embed. title — accessible name for the frame. loading — ''lazy'' to defer offscreen loading.',null,'<iframe src="https://example.com" title="Embedded site" loading="lazy"></iframe>','html','Always set a title attribute for screen-reader users, and use sandbox for untrusted content.',ARRAY['html','embedding']::text[],46),
('html','tags','html-tags-047','<canvas>','<canvas id="c" width="300" height="150"></canvas>','Provides a blank, scriptable bitmap surface for drawing graphics, charts or animations via JavaScript.','width/height — drawing surface dimensions in pixels.',null,'<canvas id="chart" width="400" height="200"></canvas>','html','The element itself is just a container — drawing requires the Canvas 2D or WebGL API via JavaScript.',ARRAY['html','graphics','javascript']::text[],47),
('html','tags','html-tags-048','<svg>','<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">...</svg>','Embeds Scalable Vector Graphics directly in HTML, defining shapes and paths that stay crisp at any resolution.','viewBox — coordinate system of the drawing. width/height — rendered size.',null,'<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="50">
