('html','tags','html-tags-050','<dialog>','<dialog open>...</dialog>','Represents a native modal or non-modal dialog box, such as a confirmation prompt or an interactive popup.','open — shows the dialog non-modally. showModal()/close() — JS methods to control modal display.',null,'<dialog id="d">
