('css','grid','css-grid-012','repeat()','repeat(count, track-size)','Repeats a track size pattern a given number of times inside grid-template-columns/rows, avoiding manual repetition.','count — number of repetitions or auto-fill/auto-fit. track-size — the size to repeat.',null,'.container {
