('css','other-features','css-other-features-012','Shorthand properties',null,'Properties like margin, background, font, and border that let you set several related longhand properties in a single declaration.',null,null,'margin: 10px 20px; /* top/bottom: 10px, left/right: 20px */','css','Omitted values in a shorthand reset to their initial value, which can accidentally undo an earlier longhand declaration.',ARRAY['css','concepts','shorthand']::text[],12),
('css','other-features','css-other-features-013','currentColor','property: currentColor;','A keyword that resolves to the element''s own computed color value, useful for keeping borders, shadows, or fills in sync with text color.',null,null,'.icon {
