('css','position','css-position-008','Stacking context',null,'A conceptual grouping created by certain properties (like position + z-index, opacity < 1, or transform) where z-index values only compare against siblings inside the same context.',null,null,null,null,'A high z-index inside a low stacking context can still be visually behind an element with a much lower z-index in a different context.',ARRAY['css','position','stacking']::text[],8),
