('dom','common-apis','dom-common-apis-001','MutationObserver','new MutationObserver(callback)','Watches a DOM subtree for changes such as added/removed nodes, attribute changes, or text changes, and invokes a callback with a batch of mutations.','callback — function receiving (mutations, observer). observe() takes a target node and an options object (childList, attributes, subtree, etc.).','A MutationObserver instance with observe()/disconnect() methods.','const obs = new MutationObserver((muts) => console.log(muts));
