('dom','common-apis','dom-common-apis-004','requestAnimationFrame()','window.requestAnimationFrame(callback)','Schedules a callback to run before the browser''s next repaint, ideal for smooth, jank-free visual updates.','callback — receives a high-resolution timestamp (DOMHighResTimeStamp).','A request id usable with cancelAnimationFrame().','function loop(t) {
