('dom','events','dom-events-004','Event bubbling vs capturing',null,'Events travel in three phases: capturing (from window down to the target), target, then bubbling (from the target back up to window). addEventListener() listens on the bubbling phase by default.',null,null,'parent.addEventListener(''click'', handler, { capture: true }); // fires during capture phase','javascript','Pass { capture: true } as the third argument to listen during the capture phase instead of bubbling.',ARRAY['dom','events','propagation']::text[],4),
