('dom','events','dom-events-009','CustomEvent','new CustomEvent(type, { detail, bubbles, cancelable })','Creates a custom, application-defined event that can carry arbitrary data and be dispatched on any DOM element.','type — event name. detail — any data to attach. bubbles/cancelable — booleans controlling propagation behavior.','A new CustomEvent instance.','el.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(''item-added'', { detail: { id: 1 }, bubbles: true }));','javascript','Listen for it like any built-in event with addEventListener(''item-added'', handler); data is read from event.detail.',ARRAY['dom','events','custom-events']::text[],9),
